---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Plan a Visit
description: "Service times, directions, and what to expect when you visit Faith Baptist Church of Raymore, Missouri."
---

<div class="page-head">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="page-head__eyebrow">Plan a visit</p>
    <h1>We would be glad to have you</h1>
    <p class="page-head__lede">Come as you are. Here is everything you need to find us and know what to expect.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="wrap prose">
  <div class="full-width">
    <h2>Service times</h2>
    <div class="times__grid">
      {%- for service in church.services %}
      <div class="time-card">
        <p class="time-card__day">{{ service.day }}</p>
        <span class="time-card__time">{{ service.time }}</span>
        <p class="time-card__name">{{ service.name }}</p>
        {%- if service.note %}<span class="time-card__note">For {{ service.note }}</span>{% endif %}
      </div>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>

  {#
    Column split is chosen to balance height: the map plus the three short
    contact blocks on the left, the three prose blocks on the right.
  #}
  <div class="visit-grid">
    <div>
      <a class="map-link" href="{{ church.address.mapUrl }}">
        <img src="/assets/images/Map.png" alt="Map showing Faith Baptist Church at 414 S. Franklin Street, Raymore, Missouri" loading="lazy">
        <span>Open in Google Maps</span>
      </a>

      <div class="info-block">
        <h2>Where we meet</h2>
        <address>
          {{ church.address.street }}<br>
          {{ church.address.city }}, {{ church.address.state }} {{ church.address.zip }}
        </address>
        <p><a class="btn btn--outline" href="{{ church.address.directionsUrl }}">Get directions</a></p>
      </div>

      <div class="info-block">
        <h2>Get in touch</h2>
        <p>Call or email us and we will be happy to answer any question you have before you visit.</p>
        <p><strong><a href="{{ church.phoneHref }}">{{ church.phone }}</a></strong></p>
        <p><strong><a href="mailto:{{ church.email }}">{{ church.email }}</a></strong></p>
      </div>

      <div class="info-block">
        <h2>Mailing address</h2>
        <address>{{ church.mailing.line }}</address>
        <p><em>{{ church.mailing.note }}</em></p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div>
      <div class="info-block">
        <h2>What to expect</h2>
        <p>You will find a warm and friendly congregation, singing from the hymnal, and preaching straight from the Bible. There is no dress code and no pressure &mdash; we are simply glad when someone comes to worship with us.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="info-block">
        <h2>Bringing children?</h2>
        <p>A clean and secure nursery is available for ages 0&ndash;3 during every worship service, and there are Sunday School classes for every age. All of our children&rsquo;s workers have approved background checks along with experience and training in children&rsquo;s ministry.</p>
        <p><a href="/ministries/children-s-ministry/">About our children&rsquo;s ministry</a></p>
      </div>

      <div class="info-block">
        <h2>Watch first</h2>
        <p>If you would rather see a service before visiting, our services are streamed live and archived on YouTube.</p>
        <p><a href="{{ church.social.youtube }}">Visit our YouTube channel</a></p>
      </div>

      <div class="info-block">
        <h2>Questions before you come?</h2>
        <p>Call <a href="{{ church.phoneHref }}">{{ church.phone }}</a> or email <a href="mailto:{{ church.email }}">{{ church.email }}</a>, or read more <a href="/about-us/what-we-believe/">about what we believe</a> and <a href="/about-us/meet-our-staff/">who serves here</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
